{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2023-04", "window": 2, "start_date": 1680912000, "end_date": 1681603199, "month_true_total": 35, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:22:17 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "136737806", "author": {"steamid": "76561198854010521", "personaname": "Ben", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ReallyJoyless/", "num_games_owned": 663, "num_reviews": 263, "playtime_forever": 3823, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3584, "last_played": 1681576360, "avatar": "28c86ac757249555d23a08d8b40723b5b1f487f6"}, "language": "english", "review": "the risk of rain is very high today", "timestamp_created": 1681561880, "timestamp_updated": 1681561880, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "136676293", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960783864", "personaname": "BryanwithaYan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bryanwithayan/", "num_games_owned": 489, "num_reviews": 153, "playtime_forever": 772, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 772, "last_played": 1681472383, "avatar": "c0eca231244c077f402e3f0034442abf47807935"}, "language": "english", "review": "Roguelike kiting simulator. Difficulty scales as time passes, forcing you to decide between a hasty end to the level or a bit more exploring and farming. Unfortunately if you take too long then the difficulty scales too high and you'll realistically be unable to progress any farther on your playthrough. Some of the items are interesting. Depending on your seed you may find yourself constantly shooting off rockets and mortars, or you may find that you've amassed a drone army.\n\nI found the starting difficulty a bit too grindy right off the bat, and the last boss is quite difficult. He constantly teleports on top of you, contradicting to the entire way the game has trained you to play. Would not pay full price for this, but could be worth a play if you really like roguelikes.", "timestamp_created": 1681472949, "timestamp_updated": 1681472949, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "136658448", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083045233", "personaname": "average.nap.enjoyer", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/averagenapenjoyer/", "num_games_owned": 478, "num_reviews": 164, "playtime_forever": 1270, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1235, "last_played": 1697939275, "avatar": "33f04a8c1cabb5dbdc623651f321695dcd6ad9a1"}, "language": "english", "review": "in comparison to risk of rain 2 this game has a slower early game, which ramps up in to a far more insane endgame, but also just overall it is harder and more unforgiving. Base survivors are less powerful and rely more on items, but it makes it so that you are encouraged more to maximise the value out of your abilities and their cool downs. I like the fact that your character is absolutely tiny in comparison to pretty much every other enemy.", "timestamp_created": 1681437701, "timestamp_updated": 1681437701, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.439999967813491821", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "136646210", "author": {"st